ula)","d":"Shoot is Tue Dec 1, 2026, 9:00 AM Lima at Lima studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Paula and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-17T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 17, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Paula Ciaroz)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:H1","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Nov 20 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:PO1","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Pose sheet #1: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:SKP","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: coastal humidity with strong UV. Use SPF 50 and reapply, a light moisturizer, and rinse salt and sweat off. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Lima","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lima (Mon Nov 23 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Paula Ciaroz)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Tue Dec 1, 2026.","u":"2026-11-24T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 24, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Paula Ciaroz)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: ceviche, grilled chicken or fish, quinoa, lentils, avocado and fruit. Lighter lomo saltado is fine.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/Lima","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Lima (Wed Nov 25 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Paula)","d":"Call sheet to Paula and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lima, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Tue Dec 1, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-27T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Fri Nov 27, 5:00 PM Lima (Fri Nov 27 5:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1","a":"model","o":"Paula Ciaroz","t":"Test shoot 1: Paula","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lima studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-01T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Lima","w":"Tue Dec 1, 9:00 AM Lima (Tue Dec 1 9:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-01T22:00:00Z","loc":"Lima studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Paula)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-03T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 3, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:paula-ciaroz:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Paula Ciaroz)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12