sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Sae Kashiwabara","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:G1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","u":"2026-11-13T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Nov 13 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:V1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Passport check and visa documents","d":"Passport valid 6+ months after return. Send the documents your attorney asked for.","u":"2026-11-13T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Nov 13 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:V2","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"US counsel engaged and retainer paid (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Engage the immigration attorney and agree the fee. The legal fee is quoted separately and is not part of the model's travel amount.","u":"2026-11-13T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 13, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:H1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Nov 20 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SKP","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: cold, dry winter. Use a richer cream, lip balm at night, lukewarm (not hot) water, and a hydrating mask twice a week. SPF stays on. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:WK1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: bibimbap with extra vegetables and egg, grilled fish, tofu stew, seaweed soup, kimchi and fruit. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Nov 25 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Sae)","d":"Shoot is Wed Dec 9, 2026, 9:00 AM Seoul at Seoul studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Sae and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:V3","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"US work visa filed (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Petition or application filed with counsel; save the receipt number in the portal.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Wed Dec 9, 2026.","u":"2026-12-02T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 2, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Sae)","d":"Call sheet to Sae and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Seoul, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-04T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Wed Dec 9, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-07T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Dec 7, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 7 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Sae Kashiwabara and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: New York Sat Jan 30 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW). Estimated total $4,329 (flights $1,700, housing $1,260, meals and transport $855, transfers $120, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Test shoot 1: Sae","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Seoul studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-09T00:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Dec 9, 9:00 AM Seoul (Tue Dec 8 7:00 PM ET)","en":"2026-12-09T08:00:00Z","loc":"Seoul studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $4,329","d":"Your season itinerary: New York Sat Jan 30 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW). Estimated total $4,329: flights $1,700, housing $1,260, meals and local transport $855, airport transfers $120, visa and insurance $0, contingency $394. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 11 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-11T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 11 3:00 AM ET)","amt":4329},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $4,329).","u":"2026-12-11T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 11 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $4,329. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Sae)","d":"Send the first select