5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 18 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:H2e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 18 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:H3","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Dec 18 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:V5","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"US VISA DECISION DEADLINE (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"No decision by now: escalate to Demontez and counsel.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Sae)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Sae)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-22T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 22, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Sae)","d":"Shoot is Tue Jan 12, 2027, 9:00 AM Seoul at Seoul studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Sae and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-29T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 29, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Tue Jan 12, 2027.","u":"2027-01-05T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Jan 5, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:CK1","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Mid-season check-in call with your agent","d":"30 minutes: how you feel, sleep, food, skin, walk and travel. Bring questions.","u":"2027-01-06T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"meeting","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Jan 6, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Jan 6 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-06T08:30:00Z","loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Tue Jan 12, 2027. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2027-01-08T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Jan 8, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Jan 8 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Sae)","d":"Call sheet to Sae and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Seoul, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2027-01-08T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 8, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Test shoot 2: Sae","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Seoul studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2027-01-12T00:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"