y":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-house","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Housing confirmed and address sent (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Confirm the bed, key pickup and house rules and send them to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-01-22T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:V7","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"US visa in the passport (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Visa verified: name, dates, category. Then tickets.","u":"2027-01-22T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK3","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-25T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:WK3","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-25T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:WK3e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Walk practice video #3 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Jan 25 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Sae Kashiwabara","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-01-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Sae)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-ready","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Pre-flight check: documents, health and packing","d":"Passport, visa, tickets, insurance card, prescriptions, charger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-01-27T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Jan 27, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Jan 27 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Arrival: Sae lands","d":"Landing in New York. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-30T17:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Jan 30, 12:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":"New York","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK4","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Feb 1 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Sae)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-02-01T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 1, 10:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-01T15:45:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:DG","a":"model","o":"Sae Kashiwabara","t":"Digitals session (Sae)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-02-03T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Feb 3, 11:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-03T18:00:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-02-05T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Feb 5, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sae-kashiwabara:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Sae Kashiwabara)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-02-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 8, 5:00 PM ET"}]},{"name":"Sullivan Jordan","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-25","key_label":"Paris Haute Couture SS27","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Sullivan. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Emma.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Haute Couture SS27 (Mon Jan 25 to Thu Jan 28); New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14) (Wed Feb 10 to Tue Feb 16); Paris Women's FW27-28 (Mon Mar 1 to Tue Mar 9).","market":"Base: Atlanta. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14), Paris Women's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Also placing her in London, Milan and Spain.","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Sullivan Jordan","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Thu Nov 19, 2026.","u":"2026-11-12T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 12, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Sullivan)","d":"Shoot is Thu Nov 19, 2026, 9:00 AM ET at Atlanta studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Sullivan and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-12T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 12, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:G1","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14), Paris Women's FW27-28.","u":"2026-11-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Sullivan)","d":"Call sheet to Sullivan and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM ET, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-16T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:SK1","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Thu Nov 19, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-17T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 17, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Test shoot 1: Sullivan","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Atlanta studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-11-19T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 19, 9:00 AM ET","en":"2026-11-19T22:00:00Z","loc":"Atlanta studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:H1","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:SKP","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: warm and humid. A light lotion moisturizer and SPF daily. Rinse after workouts. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Sullivan)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:WK1","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: bowls with a grilled protein, a whole grain and vegetables; eggs, Greek yogurt, oats, fruit and nuts. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Sullivan)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-01T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 1, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Sullivan)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-03T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 3, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Sullivan Jordan and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: Paris Wed Jan 20 to Fri Jan 29 (Couture); New York Sat Feb 6 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $6,523 (flights $2,300, housing $1,925, meals and transport $1,345, transfers $360, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $6,523. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $6,523","d":"Your season itinerary: Paris Wed Jan 20 to Fri Jan 29 (Couture); New York Sat Feb 6 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $6,523: flights $2,300, housing $1,925, meals and local transport $1,345, airport transfers $360, visa and insurance $0, contingency $593. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","amt":6523},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $6,523).","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Sullivan Jordan)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $6,523.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:SK2","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:WK2","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Walk video #2: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Sullivan Jordan","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:H2","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Travel health: ask your clinician about vaccines or medicines for your route, carry a copy of prescriptions, and bring your insurance card. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:H2e","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:H3","a":"model","o":"Sullivan Jordan","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Sullivan)","d":"Shoot is Wed Jan 6, 2027, 9:00 AM ET at Atlanta studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Sullivan and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-23T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 23, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:sullivan-jordan:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Sullivan)","d":"Call sheet to Sullivan and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 